    ./in.cue:24:21
[structural_cycle] cycles.B.a: structural cycle:
    ./in.cue:24:21
[structural_cycle] cycles.C.c: structural cycle:
    ./in.cue:24:21
[structural_cycle] lookupCycles.select.n.n: structural cycle:
    ./in.cue:164:36
[structural_cycle] lookupCycles.self.z: structural cycle:
